You can view Amazon’s top-selling product lists here:

- Amazon Best Sellers (by category): https://www.amazon.com/Best-Sellers — shows top-selling items updated hourly.  
- Amazon Movers & Shakers: https://www.amazon.com/gp/movers-and-shakers — fastest-rising products by sales rank.  
- Amazon Most Wished For: https://www.amazon.com/gp/most-wished-for — items most frequently added to wish lists.  
- Amazon New Releases: https://www.amazon.com/gp/new-releases — top new items by category.

On the Amazon app or website: open the menu → Shop by Department → Best Sellers (or search “Best Sellers”).  
For more advanced analytics (sales estimates, historical rank), use third-party tools like Jungle Scout, Helium 10, or Keepa.
